<title>USA: Fla. $7.6 mln housing bonds yld 6.125 pct in 2036.</title>
<headline>Fla. $7.6 mln housing bonds yld 6.125 pct in 2036.</headline>
<text>
<p>Florida Housing Finance Agency</p>
<p>RE: $7,580,000*</p>
<p>Housing Revenue Bonds, 1996 Series Q</p>
<p>(The Landings at Sea Forest Apartments Project)</p>
<p>SUBJECT TO ALTERNATIVE MINIMUM TAX</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA	AMBAC INSURED</p>
